{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822340/extras/gameplayEN.png?t=1750202202\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>GOP STOP AUTO \u2013 This is a dynamic first-person shooter in which you will exterminate hordes of evil memes. You appear in a large, open for exploration arena and in fact you just need to quickly get to your car to get out of here, but you will not be able to open the door to the garage until you destroy 30 opponents. Evil memes are everywhere. They are thirsty for your blood. They will pursue you wherever you go. Use a wide arsenal of firearms to get rid of these annoying entities from the lower Internet. Get diamonds for destroying memes and open new levels!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822340/extras/gameplay.png?t=1750202202\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822340/extras/weaponEN.png?t=1750202202\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Exploring the arena, you can find a variety of guns: shotguns, Kalashnikovs, pistols and single-shot rifles. You can only change weapons when you find a new one, so be careful in your choice.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822340/extras/weapon.png?t=1750202202\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822340/extras/LevelsEN.png?t=1750202202\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>In the main menu, you can choose one of three levels. Destroy living memes, earn diamonds and open all levels!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822340/extras/levels.png?t=1750202202\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822340/extras/carEN.png?t=1750202202\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>After you get to the garage, you can choose one of the available cars, upgrade it and even repaint it in your favorite color. Race along the track and collect diamonds!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822340/extras/car.png?t=1750202202\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822340/extras/wishlistEN.png?t=1750202202\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Many thanks to everyone who paid attention to the project. Please add the game to your wishlist so as not to miss the release. This will greatly help the game in promotion.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822340/extras/wishlist.png?t=1750202202\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3822340?t=1750202202","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822340/dd2d560f893dca870eb66f4c41a4ddf3517a3044/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750202202","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822340/8dbb88ce382a3efd9f9104a470c5010253dbc1dd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750202202","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/38